# The overlay's Rust rules (design §4.2 "Rust rules"): rustc.bzl (rustc_library,
# rustc_binary, rustc_proc_macro), and rustc_api_level.bzl with api_level.bzl, which the
# Rust toolchains (toolchain/rust.BUILD.bazel) use for the API-level cfgs; host.bzl, which
# vendored Go BUILD files load their host constraints from (M7); fidl.bzl (fidl_library)
# and fidl_rust.bzl (its Rust bindings), which vendored FIDL libraries load (M8), and
# build_info.bzl, the build arguments vendored BUILD files read (M8); fidl_rust_next.bzl,
# the rust_next bindings and the allowlist the vendored fidl_next crates load (M8b).
